		{"id":"f8720d55c03d7d23","type":"text","text":"**WHAT IS A GOOD DAY TO YOU?**","x":5354,"y":-1400,"width":310,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b7af72ae71b63868","type":"text","text":"## Role B — PPJ Employee\n\nYou hear:\n\nPlease correct the document and send it soon because we need it for the shipment.\n\nYou need to clarify:\n\n1. Which document?\n    \n2. What information is incorrect?\n    \n3. Which quantity is correct?\n    \n4. What is the exact deadline?\n    \n5. What will the supplier do next?\n    \n\n### Use at least six expressions\n\nSorry, I didn’t catch the last part.\n\n  \n\nCould you repeat that more slowly, please?\n\n  \n\nWhich document do you mean?\n\n  \n\nWhich quantity should we use?\n\n  \n\nWhen exactly do you need it?\n\n  \n\nCould you explain what needs to be corrected?\n\n  \n\nLet me make sure I understand correctly.\n\n  \n\nSo, we should use 480 pieces, right?\n\n  \n\nThank you for clarifying that.\n\n  \n\n## Your Final Summary\n\nComplete before ending the conversation:\n\nLet me summarize the instruction.\n\n  \n\nWe need to revise the __________________________.\n\n  \n\nThe correct quantity is __________________ pieces.\n\n  \n\nWe need to send it before ______________________.","x":4020,"y":8720,"width":604,"height":1000},
		{"id":"e47b4768d9572913","type":"text","text":"SOUL - FOOD ","x":7860,"y":-720,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7faa9276ec23ad6b","type":"text","text":"PIZZA - HAMBURGER - SALAD","x":7710,"y":-580,"width":300,"height":60},
		{"id":"fa966dd7b52eec0e","type":"text","text":"**WHAT IS A GOOD DAY TO YOU?**","x":5955,"y":300,"width":310,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bede87ad3d00d2c3","type":"text","text":"MRS MARRY:\nA GOOD DAY TO ME IS A DAY THAT:\n\n- I SEE MY FAMILY AND FRIENDS ARE STILL STRONG AND WELL\n- I HAVE DINNER WITH MY FAMILY \n- I GO PLAYING PICKLE-BALL WITH MY TEAM \n- AND GO SHOPPING WITH MY FRIENDS AND BUY NICE CLOTHES \n- THEN I GO TO THE CINEMA TO WATCH MOVIES WITH MY SON","x":5955,"y":523,"width":365,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"9e0a3d1241db198a","type":"text","text":"EXERCISE 1: ANSWER ON WHAT WOULD BE A GOOD DAY TO YOU\n\nEXERCISE 2: RETELL ABOUT A CO-WORKER'S VIEW ON HOW WOULD BE A GOOD DAY TO THEM ","x":5140,"y":197,"width":300,"height":163,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d83ca1a9396c3206","type":"text","text":"MRS TANYA:\nA GOOD DAY TO ME IS A DAY THAT:\n\n- I FINISH WORK AND COME HOME - SEEING THAT MY HOUSE IS CLEANED AND THE FOOD ARE COOKED \n- MY CHILDREN HAVE GONE TO MY HOMETOWN + MY HUSBAND HAS ALREADY TAKEN SHOWER \n- THE PRODUCTION ISNT DELAYED \n- THEN I CAN SLEEP (VERB) WELL AND DREAM BIG","x":6340,"y":780,"width":380,"height":310,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"cb892fa153708e45","type":"text","text":"I - MY \nSHE - HER\nHE - HIS","x":6055,"y":151,"width":111,"height":92,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"03f9d8c2464a8044","type":"text","text":"MRS. SOPHIA\nA GOOD DAY TO ME IS A DAY THAT:\n- I HAVE MORE TIME TO MYSELF\n- AND HAVE TIME TO GO **PLAY PICKLE-BALL**  AND **DO YOGA** \n- THEN I CAN GO OUT WITH MY FAMILY\n- AND THAT I CAN COOK FOR MY FAMILY","x":6300,"y":75,"width":340,"height":285,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ec7368a640727142","type":"text","text":"MR. MIKE:\nMY GOOD DAY IS A DAY THAT \n- I SEE MY KIDS ARE WELL AND STRONG\n- THEN I TAKE THEM TO SCHOOL\n- THEN I HEAD TO THE CAFES ALONE\n- AFTER THAT I CHECK UP SOME TASKS \n- AND SPEND SOME TIMES FOR SOCIAL MEDIA\n- I COME TO THE COMPANY - SEE MY CO-WORKERS AND NOT SEEING TOO MANY COMPLAINTS FROM OTHER DEPARTMENTS - ESPECIALLY FROM MRS HUYEN \n- THEN I COULD PLAY PICKLEBALL WITH MY TEAM - AND HAVE A WONDERFULL TIME ","x":5460,"y":85,"width":460,"height":387},
		{"id":"74f4f6ccfda80300","type":"text","text":"MRS SUNNY:\n\nA GOOD DAY FOR ME IS A DAY THAT \n- I CAN MEET MY CHILDHOOD FRIENDS \n- AND LISTEN TO MUSIC - FROM MODERN TALKING\n- THEN WE GO TO THE ZOO\n- HOPE THAT WE CAN SLEEP FULL 10-HOURS\n","x":5140,"y":490,"width":320,"height":290,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"eb0a7f3378064565","type":"text","text":"MRS LUNA:\nA GOOD DAY IS A DAY THAT\n- I WAKE UP EARLY \n- I HAVE TIME TO LISTEN TO MUSIC \n- AND HAVE BREAKFAST \n- AND GET TO WORK AT 8:00AM\n- NO ISSUES HAPPEN AT WORK \n- NO COMPLAINTS FROM OTHER DEPARTMENTS \n- EVERY WORK RUNS SMOOTHLY \n- NO COOKING + CLEANING","x":5600,"y":660,"width":320,"height":350,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"8c8bfb0e138cac8e","type":"text","text":"MRS JENNY\nA GOOD DAY TO ME IS A DAY THAT \n- I FINISH WORKS AND COME HOME EARLY \n- MY SONS ARE OBEDIENT \n- WE HAVE DINNER TOGETHER AND WATCH OUR FAVORITE MOVIES ","x":5300,"y":797,"width":280,"height":277},
		{"id":"0638e9f7b5565bc1","type":"text","text":"MRS LILY:\nA GOOD DAY TO ME IS A DAY THAT:\n- THAT I HAVE TIME TO COOK WITH MY DAUGHTER\n- I GO OUT TO HAVE COFFEE WITH MY FRIENDS\n- IN THE MORNING, I HAVE TIME TO LISTEN TO MUSIC \n- IN THE EVENING I CAN WATCH MOVIES WITH MY KIDS + AND HAVE TIME **TO GO ON A VACATION** WITH MY FAMILY\n- THEN I HAVE GOOD SLEEP (NOUN)","x":6420,"y":380,"width":400,"height":375,"color":"3"},
